import { onError } from "h3";

// Handling errors using middleware
app.use(
  onError((error, event) => {
    console.error(error);
  }),
);
```

> [!TIP]
> When using nested apps, global hooks of sub-apps will not be called. Therefore it is better to use `onError` middleware.
